## Normative integrity traceability

Vault-wide rules include globally unique IDs; valid and resolvable scope; one root self-scope;
one active schema definition; declared-schema interpretation; reference integrity; denied
self-reference except defined exceptions; acyclic supersession, derived-provenance, and
operator-rooted authority chains; kind/class requirements; and directory mismatch warnings.
